x-info.content:
Overrides the default type names shown in the multiple-type switcher.

Works as a **jedison option** (applies globally to all switchers):

```js
jedison({
  switcherTypeLabels: {
    'String': 'Text',
    'Boolean': 'Toggle',
    'Null': 'None'
  }
})
```

Or as an **x-option on the schema field** (applies only to that field):

```json
{
  "x-switcherTypeLabels": {
    "String": "Text",
    "Boolean": "Toggle",
    "Null": "None"
  }
}
```

Keys are the **default label names** (`String`, `Boolean`, `Integer`, `Number`, `Array`, `Object`, `Null`). Only matched keys are replaced; unmatched labels remain unchanged.
